lemma legac (hL:t ≤ ℓ)(hx:ℓ ≤ i)(hi:i<n) (v':D i→ℝ) (h0:∀ j:D i, |v' j| * egg P₀ A Θ Uv i0 Gn ξ Ξ (x:=x) (Pt:=Pt) i (ψ i j) ≤ Wc i): Kc i hi.le (O₁b i) (δ i) (fun j=> (v' j:ℂ) • ψ i j) (fun _=>Xp i) (DP i) (Talent.scale v' (Gq i)):=by
     let Fp:= fPearl P₀ A Θ Uv Gn ξ x Pt i (ψ i); let p:= Tt i; let Γ:= EP i; let T':= Xp i; -- XP caps typo
     have hv:T' > 0:= (hM.care i).shape.1; have hΓ:1 ≤ Γ:= Tribute.stem_h ..
     have heZ(j:D i): 0<p (ψ i j) := health P₀ A Θ Uv Gn ξ (ψ i j) (h.huge _ _ hx hi.le)
     have hV(j:D i): |v' j| ≤ Fp j:= by
          change _≤ T' /p _; apply (le_div_iff₀ (heZ j)).2; exact (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (le_mul_of_one_le_left (heZ _).le hΓ) (abs_nonneg _)).trans (h0 j)
     have hQ:=birthR P₀ A X B T Z V U W F hp hX E M₀ he Y hh C Ht O L1 hC Θ Uv i0 Gn ξ Ξ Fi Ue D ψ DP O₁b δ Tq wΓ Gq ℓ t hM h hPz hGz hYt hTol hL hx hi v' hV -- he
     refine raisesC P₀ A X B T V U W E M₀ he Y C Ht O L1 hC Θ Uv Gn ξ (δ i) _ (O₁b i) (DP i) _ _ _ hQ _ fun j=>?_ -- check order
     let Q:=v' j; let x:=p (ψ i j);
     change |Q| /(T'/x)*(Γ*T') ≤ _; refine Eq.trans_le ?_ (show |Q| * (Γ*x) ≤ T' from h0 j); have hX':0<x:=heZ j; field_simp
